<http://ops-sys.local/ontology#decision/research.simulation-result-2026-10-12-forecast-driven-home-controller-saves-145-190-eur> <http://ops-sys.local/ontology#rationale> "results/household_simulation_2025.md; synthetic load, weak forecasts, Spain compensation cap not modelled." <http://ops-sys.local/ontology#graph/ws/energy> .
<http://ops-sys.local/ontology#decision/research.simulation-result-2026-10-12-forecast-driven-home-controller-saves-145-190-eur> <http://ops-sys.local/ontology#name> "Simulation result 2026-10-12: forecast-driven home controller saves 145-190 EUR/yr per PV+battery+EV home on time-of-use/hourly tariffs with market-paid exports (77 on flat tariff), 45-100 EUR/yr per battery-only home with market-paid exports, ~0 with fixed export prices; 26-67 EUR/yr over simple smart-charging rules. Target installers whose customers have EVs and market-paid exports (Goldenergy, Lumio, SotySolar, Feníe channel); Clevergy as partner/competitor; hold EDP and Galp until the friend's employer is known." <http://ops-sys.local/ontology#graph/ws/energy> .
<http://ops-sys.local/ontology#decision/research.simulation-result-2026-10-12-forecast-driven-home-controller-saves-145-190-eur> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://ops-sys.local/ontology#Decision> <http://ops-sys.local/ontology#graph/ws/energy> .
