<http://ops-sys.local/ontology#note/iberia-home-optimiser-prospects-2026-10-12-outreach-prospects-iberia-md-top> <http://ops-sys.local/ontology#noteType> "insight" <http://ops-sys.local/ontology#graph/ws/energy> .
<http://ops-sys.local/ontology#note/iberia-home-optimiser-prospects-2026-10-12-outreach-prospects-iberia-md-top> <http://ops-sys.local/ontology#noteText> "Iberia home-optimiser prospects (2026-10-12, outreach/prospects_iberia.md): top buyers Galp Solar (>22k Iberian installs, ~250 batteries 2025), EDP Comercial (>140k PT homes, hourly-indexed offer), Feníe Energía (~2,000-2,400 installer agents, 400k clients), SotySolar, Goldenergy (all-GoodWe, OMIE surplus). Most direct competitor: Clevergy (Madrid white-label retailer platform, claims 500k homes, 55 brands, E-REDES integration). Others: Holaluz in-house RL Algorithm Hub, Octopus Kraken, 1KOMMA5 Heartbeat (Spain launch pending Apr 2026)." <http://ops-sys.local/ontology#graph/ws/energy> .
