<http://ops-sys.local/ontology#note/portugal-update-2026-10-12-only-20-mw-grid-batteries-at-end-2025-apren-3-gw> <http://ops-sys.local/ontology#noteText> "Portugal update 2026-10-12: only 20 MW grid batteries at end-2025 (APREN); 3 GW target by 2030 (National Energy Storage Strategy), 4.5 GW by 2040; ~500 MW PRR projects coming online; Sept 2026 auction 750 MVA standalone + 300 MVA co-located, fully merchant (no availability payment), results not yet published; capacity market planned, no date. Portugal is early, not saturated: the auction winners are the prospect list." <http://ops-sys.local/ontology#graph/ws/energy> .
