<http://ops-sys.local/ontology#proposal/p-0001> <http://ops-sys.local/ontology#proposedText> "Rank markets and wedges on business merit only (market size, money a better model can move, competition, access). Founder location and language are not ranking criteria." <http://ops-sys.local/ontology#graph/ws/energy> .
