<http://ops-sys.local/ontology#note/track-de-small-asset-2026-10-11-household-vpp-aggregation-in-germany-is-closed> <http://ops-sys.local/ontology#hasDomain> <http://ops-sys.local/ontology#domain/research> <http://ops-sys.local/ontology#graph/ws/energy> .
<http://ops-sys.local/ontology#note/track-de-small-asset-2026-10-11-household-vpp-aggregation-in-germany-is-closed> <http://ops-sys.local/ontology#createdAt> "2026-10-11T17:02:33Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <http://ops-sys.local/ontology#graph/ws/energy> .
<http://ops-sys.local/ontology#note/track-de-small-asset-2026-10-11-household-vpp-aggregation-in-germany-is-closed> <http://ops-sys.local/ontology#status> "active" <http://ops-sys.local/ontology#graph/ws/energy> .
<http://ops-sys.local/ontology#note/track-de-small-asset-2026-10-11-household-vpp-aggregation-in-germany-is-closed> <http://ops-sys.local/ontology#noteType> "insight" <http://ops-sys.local/ontology#graph/ws/energy> .
<http://ops-sys.local/ontology#note/track-de-small-asset-2026-10-11-household-vpp-aggregation-in-germany-is-closed> <http://ops-sys.local/ontology#noteText> "Track DE small-asset (2026-10-11): household VPP/aggregation in Germany is closed to software-only outsiders (no device access, no meter, no Bilanzkreis; Enpal/1KOMMA5/sonnen/Tibber/Octopus vertically integrated and now selling their stacks). Only 5.9% of metering points had iMSys at 30 Jun 2026 (BNetzA). Passive balancing is not permitted in DE. Plausible wedge: reBAP-exposure/forecast-error reduction for second-tier BKVs (regional suppliers, Stadtwerke, small Direktvermarkter)." <http://ops-sys.local/ontology#graph/ws/energy> .
<http://ops-sys.local/ontology#note/track-de-small-asset-2026-10-11-household-vpp-aggregation-in-germany-is-closed> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://ops-sys.local/ontology#Note> <http://ops-sys.local/ontology#graph/ws/energy> .
