<http://ops-sys.local/ontology#note/research-round-1-decomposed-into-10-parallel-evidence-tracks-de-small-asset> <http://ops-sys.local/ontology#noteText> "Research round 1 decomposed into 10 parallel evidence tracks: DE small-asset flexibility; DE B2B buyers and market plumbing; NL+BE; AT+CH+UK+Nordics; ES+PT+IT; CEE+FR screening; hardware/control stack; data and quantitative evidence; competition and precedents; funding/regulation/GTM. Notes land in research_notes/European energy flexibility startup wedges/." <http://ops-sys.local/ontology#graph/ws/energy> .
