<http://ops-sys.local/ontology#note/track-it-cee-fr-screening-2026-10-11-italy-structurally-first-market-tide-in> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://ops-sys.local/ontology#Note> <http://ops-sys.local/ontology#graph/ws/energy> .
<http://ops-sys.local/ontology#note/track-it-cee-fr-screening-2026-10-11-italy-structurally-first-market-tide-in> <http://ops-sys.local/ontology#noteText> "Track IT/CEE/FR screening (2026-10-11): Italy = structurally first-market (TIDE in force, BSP/BRP split Feb 2026, MACSE storage auctions, 6,161 CER configurations) but Italian-language GTM; Poland and Romania = second markets via BESS owners/aggregators, not households; Czechia = timing window (EDC sharing groups lose up to 50% of shareable energy until dynamic allocation Jul-Aug 2026, independent aggregators from Sep 2026); Hungary, Bulgaria, France = not now. Overlooked pockets: Italian South/islands zonal forecasting, Romanian 800 MW home-battery fleet with no VPP operator, Czech sharing-group allocation." <http://ops-sys.local/ontology#graph/ws/energy> .
<http://ops-sys.local/ontology#note/track-it-cee-fr-screening-2026-10-11-italy-structurally-first-market-tide-in> <http://ops-sys.local/ontology#noteType> "insight" <http://ops-sys.local/ontology#graph/ws/energy> .
<http://ops-sys.local/ontology#note/track-it-cee-fr-screening-2026-10-11-italy-structurally-first-market-tide-in> <http://ops-sys.local/ontology#status> "active" <http://ops-sys.local/ontology#graph/ws/energy> .
