<http://ops-sys.local/ontology#note/track-funding-regulation-gtm-2026-10-11-no-registration-found-for-a-pure> <http://ops-sys.local/ontology#noteText> "Track funding/regulation/GTM (2026-10-11): no registration found for a pure forecasting/optimisation vendor in DE (s5 EnWG only for household suppliers; MsbG s49(3) allows GDPR Art 28 processor construction) or PT (DL 15/2022: aggregation needs DGEG registration, retailers can aggregate after notice); REMIT II algo-trading duties sit on the market participant, vendor-as-PPAET unresolved (lawyer). PT procurement reform DL 177/2026 (1 Oct 2026): direct award <EUR 75k, startup-reserved procedures, free IT trial periods. EXIST: EUR 2,500-3,000/month, needs German HEI host, company must not exist before start, co-founder-abroad stance unverified. INVEST ends 31 Dec 2026. Burn scenarios ~EUR 4.4-5k solo, 9-14k team, 15-25k hardware demo per month. GmbH with PT-resident director risks management PE; Lda loses German instruments; dual structure only after first round [ADVISER]." <http://ops-sys.local/ontology#graph/ws/energy> .
<http://ops-sys.local/ontology#note/track-funding-regulation-gtm-2026-10-11-no-registration-found-for-a-pure> <http://ops-sys.local/ontology#noteType> "insight" <http://ops-sys.local/ontology#graph/ws/energy> .
